!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = RNA-seq libraries were prepared using 100-200ng of total RNA and the Illumina TruSeq Stranded mRNA reagents (Illumina; San Diego, California, USA) on a Caliper Sciclone liquid handling robot (PerkinElmer; Waltham, Massachusetts, USA) using a Caliper-developed automated script.
!Sample_description = A1
!Sample_data_processing = Sequencing data was processed using the Illumina Pipeline Software version 2.20.
!Sample_data_processing = Purity-filtered reads were adapters and quality trimmed with Cutadapt (v. 1.8, Martin 2011). Reads matching to ribosomal RNA sequences were removed with fastq_screen (v. 0.11.1). Remaining reads were further filtered for low complexity with reaper (v. 15-065, Davis et al. 2013).
!Sample_data_processing = Reads were aligned against Homo sapiens (build GRCh38) genome using STAR (v. 2.5.3a, Dobin et al. 2013).
!Sample_data_processing = The number of read counts per gene locus was summarized with htseq-count (v. 0.9.1, Anders et al. 2014) using Homo sapiens  gene annotation (build GRCh38, Ensembl v. 92).
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: Homo sapiens build GRCh38
